※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4004

※ A field is as mutable as the record holding it.  The mark is written once,
※ where the thing was made, and a field does not get to say it again.

type Point = x : u32 ; y : u32

@[startup, impure]
fn main() → u6:
    let p: Point = Point(.x ← 1u32, .y ← 2u32)
    p.x ← 9u32
    if p.x = 9u32: 0u6 else: 1u6
